									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2865 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:45:18 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16808#msg16808">Quote from: Self Destruction on May 03, 2005, 02:53:37 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16807#msg16807">Quote from: matteo on May 03, 2005, 02:05:08 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Just a suggestion...&nbsp; Why don&#039;t you guys grow the fuck up and just do a joint Coirnav raid.&nbsp; 36 flags to each guild.&nbsp; Fighting over a mob from 4 expansions ago is pretty damn idiotic.&nbsp; <br /></div><br />Sweet, another &#039;it&#039;s not cutting edge, it&#039;s trivial&#039; retired troll. Here&#039;s a suggestion for you. Why don&#039;t you go post suggestions for the game you actually play where people might give a crap? ...and take Toastie with you.<br /><br /><br /></div><br />now now, just because he hurt your e-penis&nbsp; by calling out how your &#039;accomplishments&#039; are really nothing to brag about doesnt mean matteo didn&#039;t have a good and valid idea for your guilds to try out.<br /><br />and if you seriously have a problem with me then just use the ignore option and you won&#039;t have to hear me talk about how your &#039;accomplishments&#039; really aren&#039;t.
						</td>
					</tr>
