	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16819"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 105<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								With Teeth<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16819#msg16819"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16819#msg16819">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2866 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 04:56:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16818#msg16818">Quote from: Toastie on May 03, 2005, 04:45:18 pm</a></div><div class="quote">now now, just because he hurt your e-penis&nbsp; by calling out how your &#039;accomplishments&#039; are really nothing to brag about doesnt mean matteo didn&#039;t have a good and valid idea for your guilds to try out.<br /><br />and if you seriously have a problem with me then just use the ignore option and you won&#039;t have to hear me talk about how your &#039;accomplishments&#039; really aren&#039;t.<br /></div><br />Awesome. You read as well as Shrek. It&#039;s obvious you guys can kind of read and write, but based on your level of reading comprehension, I&#039;m guessing you&#039;re posting your replies with some kind of Playskool &#039;Speak and Say&#039; toy you&#039;ve somehow got wired up to you computer. Gratz on your innovation.<br /><br />Again, so this will be twice I&#039;m having to clarify (since reading is hard stuff!), the actual validity of Matteo&#039;s suggestion was not even questioned in my post.<br /><br />As far as my e-penis is concerned, I&#039;m not worried about it. However, I think an injury to yours might be fatal judging by the way you&#039;re clinging on to your internet glory. Really though, who cares...everyone here has to know by now what you are. It&#039;s not like I&#039;m shedding light on some secret truth. Anyone who reads a few of your posts knows you&#039;re a self-important trolling attention-whore. There&#039;s no need for me to even bother replying to you, really.<br /><br />edit: Added &#039;attention-whore&#039; although that&#039;s probably what people think when they see your posts anyway, but I felt the need to have the full description available for those who might not be familiar with your brilliant prose on this message board..<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 04, 2005, 12:12:31 am by Self Destruction</i> &#187;
								</td>
