	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16820"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=338" title="View the profile of matteo">matteo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 41<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=338"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16820#msg16820"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16820#msg16820">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2867 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 05:19:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Sweet, another &#039;it&#039;s not cutting edge, it&#039;s trivial&#039; retired troll. Here&#039;s a suggestion for you. Why don&#039;t you go post suggestions for the game you actually play where people might give a crap? ...and take Toastie with you.</div><br />I still play EQ on occasion.&nbsp; It is a fun game.&nbsp; If you don&#039;t care about my opinions then dont read them.&nbsp; I really couldn&#039;t care less.&nbsp; It will be a cold day in hell before some prepubescent dumb fuck like you decides where I can and cannot post.&nbsp; If my posts bother you so much go get some counceling.<br /><br />I never referred to Coirnav as a trivial encounter.&nbsp; I think it is the most challenging and difficult encounter out of the 4 to get Time flagged.&nbsp; It is a very good accomplishment for any guild at that level of content.&nbsp; What I find totally ridiculous is that two guilds that have proven they can beat the encounter would rather blow the spawn over and over then work together to share flags.&nbsp; If you are representative of those guilds then I can now understand why.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Rashah - 60 Troll Priest - Dar Durbatuluk - Illidan Server<br /><br />Matteo - Dol Amroth - retired
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16821"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
