							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							i still play the game and i did that shit two years ago.<br /><br />my thoughts? you are all retarded.<br /><br />does anyone care? nope! good reading though. love how people get real defensive over this stuff.<br /><br />oh keep it up, train each other, blow more spawns, or hell blow each other.  just keep on keeping on.
