	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16832"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=338" title="View the profile of matteo">matteo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 41<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=338"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16832#msg16832"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16832#msg16832">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2876 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 01:44:09 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">And good job backpedaling about the slant your putting on the encounter. First it&#039;s stupid to be fighting over an encounter 4 expansions old, now it&#039;s a very good accomplishment for a guild at that level.</div><br />No backpedaling at all.  If you cannot figure out why it is stupid to fight over a 4 expansion old encounter that you have already beaten then yes.. you are an idiot.  There is a ton of content in the game.  If you get beat go do something else.  If you get beat all the time on this specific mob work something out so you can get the flags.  Noone farms this encounter for loot.  It is done for flags so you can move on to Time.  <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">If it&#039;s such a great accomplishment (now) then maybe you can understand why we might want to do it on our own?</div><br />You have done it already.  Unless you got lucky on the first kill and had to rework your strat the second and subsequent kills are just replays of an already tested strat.  There is no accomplishment in that.  Sorry.  Next you will tell me your 20th clear of PoF was a huge accomplishment!<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I think having good relations with other guilds is great, but that doesn&#039;t mean we should have to buddy up to beat mobs.</div><br />You are correct.  Dont work with guilds to finish your flags.  But then dont come to the boards bitching that soandso guild keeps beating your ass to and blowing a flag spawn that you need.  That is what my original post was in response to... A bunch of posts whining about Coirnav being blown.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Frankly, I don&#039;t care what anyone thinks about me or my guild, but the constant air of nastiness gets rather old.</div><br />Maybe you should take a moment to read over your posts.  I don&#039;t think you can compose a post without spewing some sort of bullshit about someone.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Maybe they have a right to post their elitist and condescending opinions here on this message board</div><br />Hypocrit much?  According to you some people don&#039;t have a right to post on this board because they play on another server, are retired, whatever... Your opinion is valid and theirs is not?  Who is the elitist?<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Rashah - 60 Troll Priest - Dar Durbatuluk - Illidan Server<br /><br />Matteo - Dol Amroth - retired
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
