	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16833"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 105<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								With Teeth<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16833#msg16833"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16833#msg16833">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2877 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 03:28:01 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16832#msg16832">Quote from: matteo on May 04, 2005, 01:44:09 am</a></div><div class="quote">No backpedaling at all.&nbsp; If you cannot figure out why it is stupid to fight over a 4 expansion old encounter that you have already beaten then yes.. you are an idiot.</div><br />It&#039;s pretty obvious we&#039;re working toward Time and trying to get into there before the merger. While we do hit other targets when progression mobs are not available, Ele gods, specifically Coir one final time, is our priority. So the &#039;whole lot of other content&#039; is something we&#039;re aware of and use when we have to. Now when you say fighting over a mob 4 expansions old is idiotic without so much as the slightest bit of additional information as to what you mean by that, it sounds like it&#039;s dumb because that content is trivial and unimportant or that content is old and you should be working on new content, thus making it unimportant.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">You have done it already.&nbsp; Unless you got lucky on the first kill and had to rework your strat the second and subsequent kills are just replays of an already tested strat.&nbsp; There is no accomplishment in that.&nbsp; Sorry.&nbsp; Next you will tell me your 20th clear of PoF was a huge accomplishment!</div><br />The strat we&#039;re using is sound, but it&#039;s still not exactly just going through the motions on each subsequent kill. There are new people on the raid and besides that, with an event as big as Coir...1 god, over 100+ mobs and 3 fairly tough named (especially after going through 3 waves of trash), there are 100s of variables that could happen to blow the event. Our last attempt that we should have won for example, the trash that spawned with Coir somehow agro&#039;d the raid and came to our camp whereas on a previous attempt we couldn&#039;t pull them out with a DA bard because they seemed tethered to Coir&#039;s area. While I won&#039;t expect anyone to care that we killed Coir a 2nd time, the event is still not easy.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">You are correct.&nbsp; Dont work with guilds to finish your flags.&nbsp; But then dont come to the boards bitching that soandso guild keeps beating your ass to and blowing a flag spawn that you need.&nbsp; That is what my original post was in response to... A bunch of posts whining about Coirnav being blown.</div><br />And just because the Swiss don&#039;t join sides in a war, they should expect to be carpet bombed next time a scuffle breaks out in the Middle&nbsp; East.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Maybe you should take a moment to read over your posts.&nbsp; I don&#039;t think you can compose a post without spewing some sort of bullshit about someone.</div><br />This is a recent developement, actually. I don&#039;t want to be nasty with anyone and in-game I&#039;m helpy helperton when I can be (although I can be sarcastic, usually jokingly), but it does become annoying after a while seeing everything that&#039;s not cutting edge being recieved with contempt from some of those who post here who are generally people from the higher up guilds and more often than not, people who no longer play on RN or the game at all. Again, I&#039;m not trying to single you out, but I&#039;m guessing you can understand what about your post sounded condescending to me. If it&#039;s somehow a misunderstanding (will never know) then what I&#039;ve said still applies to others who come here to give everyone else crap.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Hypocrit much?&nbsp; According to you some people don&#039;t have a right to post on this board because they play on another server, are retired, whatever... Your opinion is valid and theirs is not?&nbsp; Who is the elitist?</div><br />That&#039;s not what I said at all. In fact, I don&#039;t think I said that anyone didn&#039;t have the right to post here. But since you mention it, I don&#039;t think people who come here almost exclusively to be assholes should be allowed to post here. However, that is the discresion of the mods and Admin. I don&#039;t believe they care though.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 04, 2005, 03:30:23 am by Self Destruction</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a><br /><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
