							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16829#msg16829">Quote from: Armanthus on May 03, 2005, 10:26:45 pm</a></div><div class="quote">I like how the 2 examples from the 2 people are the same thing <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />. Their complaints go hand in hand with Zerxes&#039;s post  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /></div><br />You asked for an example you got 2.  You said UoP is perfect and has never done anything like what IL has done and you got proven wrong with past actions.  UoP will cry when this happens to them IE the conviction thing in PoTactics and cry about how UoP didn&#039;t deserve that and you have never ever done that.<br /><br />You have done it a few times have you not?  The funny part is you refuse to say you did and that you don&#039;t have the sterling silver virgin reputation you love to think you have.  You Reap what you sew.  Don&#039;t get mad when it come back to bite you in the ass later.
