							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">But since you mention it, I don&#039;t think people who come here almost exclusively to be assholes should be allowed to post here. However, that is the discresion of the mods and Admin. I don&#039;t believe they care though. </div> <br /><br />Nope, nope don&#039;t care.&nbsp; Even a retired troll or in my case dark elf can post here <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Seriously you need to calm down.&nbsp; Just because someone is retired does not mean they cant troll or post here.&nbsp; <br /><br />Ohhhhhhhhhh Moraganna <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> /hug
